Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.70,Korean,,0,0,0,,이야기 2화 '서점'에 대해서 선현우 & 최경은
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:04.74,Korean,,0,0,0,,안녕하세요. Talk To Me In Korean의 이야기 두번째 시간입니다.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:07.22,Korean,,0,0,0,,안녕하세요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:08.02,Korean,,0,0,0,,안녕하세요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:09.60,Korean,,0,0,0,,선현우입니다.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.50,Korean,,0,0,0,,안녕하세요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.10,Korean,,0,0,0,,최경은입니다.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:14.76,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 여러분, 반갑습니다.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:17.94,Korean,,0,0,0,,지금은 이야기 두번째 시간 이죠?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.56,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 맞아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:23.80,Korean,,0,0,0,,오늘은 서점에 대해서 이야기를 해 볼 거예요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:25.34,Korean,,0,0,0,,서점이요?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:26.96,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 서점.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:28.58,Korean,,0,0,0,,서점.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:30.92,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 책을 파는 곳이죠?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:33.08,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 맞아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:33.58,Korean,,0,0,0,,네.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:39.58,Korean,,0,0,0,,서점에서는 책을 파는데 사실 책이 아닌 다른 물건들도 많이 팔잖아요?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:41.38,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 맞아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.38,0:00:44.18,Korean,,0,0,0,,경은 씨 서점에 자주 가세요?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:45.08,Korean,,0,0,0,,아니요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.08,0:00:46.36,Korean,,0,0,0,,자주 못 가요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:47.94,Korean,,0,0,0,,자주 못가요?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:49.86,Korean,,0,0,0,,아니면 자주 안 가요?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:51.48,Korean,,0,0,0,,자주 못가요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:53.60,Korean,,0,0,0,,가고 싶은데 못 가요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:55.16,Korean,,0,0,0,,시간이 없어요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.04,Korean,,0,0,0,,시간이 없어요?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.04,0:00:57.88,Korean,,0,0,0,,네.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:00:59.16,Korean,,0,0,0,,너무 바빠요.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:00.60,Korean,,0,0,0,,그래요?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.16,Korean,,0,0,0,,현우 씨는요?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:04.30,Korean,,0,0,0,,저는 서점에 자주 가요.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:06.92,Korean,,0,0,0,,아, 얼마나 자주 가요?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:07.57,Korean,,0,0,0,,음 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:09.34,Korean,,0,0,0,,일주일에 두 번?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:11.26,Korean,,0,0,0,,와, 진짜요?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.26,0:01:11.90,Korean,,0,0,0,,네.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:13.78,Korean,,0,0,0,,일주일에 두 번 가고,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:19.02,Korean,,0,0,0,,그리고 그냥 실제 서점 말고 인터넷 서점도 자주 가는 것 같아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.02,0:01:22.66,Korean,,0,0,0,,그런데 인터넷 서점에서는 책을 안 사요.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:23.82,Korean,,0,0,0,,왜요?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.82,0:01:25.80,Korean,,0,0,0,,그냥 책은 음 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:31.32,Korean,,0,0,0,,직접 손으로
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:31.82,Korean,,0,0,0,,예.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:36.70,Korean,,0,0,0,,근데 저도 서점에 가는 거 좋지만, 인터넷 서점이 훨씬 싸요.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:38.74,Korean,,0,0,0,,한국에서는요.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:39.60,Korean,,0,0,0,,맞아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:40.92,Korean,,0,0,0,,그건 알고 있어요.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:43.24,Korean,,0,0,0,,알고 있는데 음 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:49.72,Korean,,0,0,0,,그냥 서점에서 직접 책을 보고 서점에서 책을 사요.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:55.36,Korean,,0,0,0,,그런데 제가 젤 좋아하는 서점은 종각에 있는
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:57.66,Korean,,0,0,0,,영풍문고인데, 아~ 영풍문고.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:59.10,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 아세요?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:02:00.78,Korean,,0,0,0,,유명하죠.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:01.46,Korean,,0,0,0,,네.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.46,0:02:03.78,Korean,,0,0,0,,영풍문고 정말 좋아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:07.02,Korean,,0,0,0,,얼마 전에 큰 공사를 했어요.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:08.94,Korean,,0,0,0,,아, 그래요?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:09.48,Korean,,0,0,0,,네,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:12.24,Korean,,0,0,0,,그래서 영풍문고가 지하 1층,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:18.02,Korean,,0,0,0,,지하 2층에 있는데 문구 (아,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:19.66,Korean,,0,0,0,,정말요?)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:26.06,Korean,,0,0,0,,그러니까 공책, 연필, 펜 또는 카메라, 스피커, 뭐, 컴퓨터 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:28.06,Korean,,0,0,0,,서점 맞아요?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.06,0:02:28.60,Korean,,0,0,0,,네.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:31.16,Korean,,0,0,0,,지하 1층만 서점이에요.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.16,0:02:34.98,Korean,,0,0,0,,지하 2층에 그렇게 문구,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:38.16,Korean,,0,0,0,,전자 제품 이런 것들이 정말 많아서,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:40.64,Korean,,0,0,0,,더 돈을 많이 벌고 있는 것 같아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:42.60,Korean,,0,0,0,,아, 그렇군요.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.60,0:02:44.12,Korean,,0,0,0,,그렇지 않아요?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:45.70,Korean,,0,0,0,,그런 것 같아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:46.66,Korean,,0,0,0,,네.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:48.82,Korean,,0,0,0,,사람들은 책도 보고 싶지만,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:50.78,Korean,,0,0,0,,서점에 갈 때는 그냥,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:54.10,Korean,,0,0,0,,그냥 무언가를 보고 싶어서 가잖아요?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:55.54,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 그렇죠.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:58.80,Korean,,0,0,0,,그리고 돈을 쓰고 싶어서 가잖아요?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:03:00.10,Korean,,0,0,0,,그래요?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:00.74,Korean,,0,0,0,,음 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:04.10,Korean,,0,0,0,,돈을 쓰고 싶어서 가는 거 아닌가요?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:04.62,Korean,,0,0,0,,아니죠.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:12.62,Korean,,0,0,0,,그게 아니라 그냥 그냥 갔는데 그런 너무 예쁜 것들이 많아서 유혹에 빠져서 사는 거에요.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:14.32,Korean,,0,0,0,,돈을 쓰는 거죠.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:14.82,Korean,,0,0,0,,(아 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:15.86,Korean,,0,0,0,,그럴 수도)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:17.50,Korean,,0,0,0,,저는 그래요.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:20.56,Korean,,0,0,0,,저도 물론 돈을 쓰고 싶지는 않아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:26.82,Korean,,0,0,0,,물건을 가져올 수 있잖아요?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:28.44,Korean,,0,0,0,,그래서 살 수 있잖아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:31.64,Korean,,0,0,0,,그런 느낌 때문에 가고,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.86,Korean,,0,0,0,,사실 보고 다 사지는 않아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:36.50,Korean,,0,0,0,,다 사면 큰일나죠.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:37.36,Korean,,0,0,0,,맞아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:38.98,Korean,,0,0,0,,돈이 없겠죠?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.82,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 큰일나요.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:44.60,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 그래서 서점에 가서 책도 보고, 문구도 보고,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:46.36,Korean,,0,0,0,,컴퓨터도 보고,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.36,0:03:48.48,Korean,,0,0,0,,새로 나온 카메라도 보고.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:50.16,Korean,,0,0,0,,그렇게 자주 해요.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:56.00,Korean,,0,0,0,,아~ 저도 종로에 있는 반디앤루니스라는 서점을 좋아하는데
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:04:01.40,Korean,,0,0,0,,그 서점을 좋아하는 이유가 우리나라에서 처음으로 서점에 의자를 놨어요.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:02.54,Korean,,0,0,0,,맞아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:03.52,Korean,,0,0,0,,맞아요,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:08.50,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 옛날에는 항상 사람들이 서서 책을 볼 수 밖에 없었거든요.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.50,0:04:15.54,Korean,,0,0,0,,그 점이 너무 좋아서,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:18.42,Korean,,0,0,0,,그 뒤부터 반디앤루니스만 가요.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:20.24,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 굉장히 편해요.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:22.32,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 맞아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:23.74,Korean,,0,0,0,,그런데 아셨어요?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:24.24,Korean,,0,0,0,,그런 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:27.88,Korean,,0,0,0,,다른 서점에도 의자가 이제 있어요.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:30.14,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 이제 생겼죠.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:31.06,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 네.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:36.38,Korean,,0,0,0,,그래서 저도 영풍문고에 가서, 의자에 앉아서 책을 볼 때도 있고,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.42,Korean,,0,0,0,,아니면 그냥,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:43.00,Korean,,0,0,0,,예 , 서서 볼 때도 있는데 저는 그 문구를 많이 볼 수 있어서 좋아요.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:45.70,Korean,,0,0,0,,그래서 서점에 자주 가요.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:46.20,Korean,,0,0,0,,(아 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:46.46,Korean,,0,0,0,,) 네.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.46,0:04:50.08,Korean,,0,0,0,,저는 일부러 문구 있는 데는 잘 안가요.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:51.90,Korean,,0,0,0,,돈을 쓰게 되니까.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:54.28,Korean,,0,0,0,,네~ 그것도 이해가 됩니다.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:55.62,Korean,,0,0,0,,네.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:56.40,Korean,,0,0,0,,네.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.66,Korean,,0,0,0,,여러분은 서점에 자주 가세요?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:05:03.46,Korean,,0,0,0,,그리고 집 근처에 서점이, 큰 서점들이 많이 있나요?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:06.40,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 그리고 책을 많이
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.40,0:05:07.08,Korean,,0,0,0,,읽으시나요?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:08.84,Korean,,0,0,0,,당연하죠.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.84,0:05:10.40,Korean,,0,0,0,,아, 그런가요?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:11.46,Korean,,0,0,0,,네.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:12.78,Korean,,0,0,0,,아 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.78,0:05:13.94,Korean,,0,0,0,,네,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.94,0:05:19.62,Korean,,0,0,0,,TalkToMeInKorean.com의 이야기 두 번째 에피소드를 들어 주셔서 감사하고요,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.62,0:05:22.26,Korean,,0,0,0,,여러분의 이야기를 들려 주세요.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:24.68,Korean,,0,0,0,,네, 코멘트로 남겨 주세요.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:25.60,Korean,,0,0,0,,네.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:29.24,Korean,,0,0,0,,그러면 저희는 코멘트 기다리고 있겠습니다.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:30.88,Korean,,0,0,0,,안녕히 계세요.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:35.88,Korean,,0,0,0,,안녕히 계세요
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.70,English,,0,0,0,,Iyagi Episode 2 'About Bookstores' Sun Hyun-woo & Choi Kyung-eun
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.70,0:00:04.74,English,,0,0,0,,Hello. This is the second episode of Talk To Me In Korean's Iyagi.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.74,0:00:07.22,English,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.22,0:00:08.02,English,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.02,0:00:09.60,English,,0,0,0,,I'm Sun Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.50,English,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.10,English,,0,0,0,,I'm Choi Kyung-eun.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.10,0:00:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, everyone, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.76,0:00:17.94,English,,0,0,0,,This is the second episode of Iyagi, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.56,0:00:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,Today, we're going to talk about bookstores.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.80,0:00:25.34,English,,0,0,0,,Bookstores?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.34,0:00:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, bookstores.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.96,0:00:28.58,English,,0,0,0,,Bookstores.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.58,0:00:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's the place where they sell books, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.92,0:00:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.08,0:00:33.58,English,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.52,0:00:39.58,English,,0,0,0,,They sell books at bookstores, but actually, they also sell many other things that aren't books, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.58,0:00:41.38,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.38,0:00:44.18,English,,0,0,0,,Kyung-eun, do you go to bookstores often?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.18,0:00:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.08,0:00:46.36,English,,0,0,0,,I can't go often.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.36,0:00:47.94,English,,0,0,0,,You can't go often?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.94,0:00:49.86,English,,0,0,0,,Or do you not go often?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.86,0:00:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,I can't go often.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.48,0:00:53.60,English,,0,0,0,,I want to go, but I can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.60,0:00:55.16,English,,0,0,0,,I don't have time.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.04,English,,0,0,0,,You don't have time?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.04,0:00:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.88,0:00:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,I'm too busy.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.16,0:01:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.16,English,,0,0,0,,How about you, Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.16,0:01:04.30,English,,0,0,0,,I go to bookstores often.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.30,0:01:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,Ah, how often do you go?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.92,0:01:07.57,English,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.57,0:01:09.34,English,,0,0,0,,Twice a week?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.34,0:01:11.26,English,,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.26,0:01:11.90,English,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.90,0:01:13.78,English,,0,0,0,,I go twice a week,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.78,0:01:19.02,English,,0,0,0,,and I think I also visit online bookstores often, not just physical bookstores .
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.02,0:01:22.66,English,,0,0,0,,But I don't buy books from online bookstores.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.66,0:01:23.82,English,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.82,0:01:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,Just books are, well...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.80,0:01:31.32,English,,0,0,0,,I tend to buy them after touching them with my own hands
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.32,0:01:31.82,English,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.32,0:01:36.70,English,,0,0,0,,But even though I also like going to bookstores, online bookstores are much cheaper.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.70,0:01:38.74,English,,0,0,0,,In Korea.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.74,0:01:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.60,0:01:40.92,English,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.92,0:01:43.24,English,,0,0,0,,I know that, but, hmm...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.24,0:01:49.72,English,,0,0,0,,I just want to see the books myself at the bookstore , so I buy books at bookstores.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.72,0:01:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,By the way, my favorite bookstore is the one in Jonggak,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.36,0:01:57.66,English,,0,0,0,,Youngpoong Bookstore, Ah~ Youngpoong Bookstore.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.66,0:01:59.10,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, do you know it?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.10,0:02:00.78,English,,0,0,0,,It's famous.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.78,0:02:01.46,English,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.46,0:02:03.78,English,,0,0,0,,Youngpoong Bookstore is really good.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.78,0:02:07.02,English,,0,0,0,,but not long ago, they did major construction work.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.02,0:02:08.94,English,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.94,0:02:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.48,0:02:12.24,English,,0,0,0,,so Youngpoong Bookstore is on the first basement floor
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.24,0:02:18.02,English,,0,0,0,,and second basement floor, (ah,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.02,0:02:19.66,English,,0,0,0,,really?)
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.66,0:02:26.06,English,,0,0,0,,I mean notebooks, pencils, pens, or cameras, speakers, well, computers...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.06,0:02:28.06,English,,0,0,0,,Is that a bookstore?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.06,0:02:28.60,English,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.60,0:02:31.16,English,,0,0,0,,Only the first basement floor is the bookstore.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.16,0:02:34.98,English,,0,0,0,,since there's stationery on the second basement floor,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.98,0:02:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,and electronic goods like that are really plentiful,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.16,0:02:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,I think they are making more money.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.64,0:02:42.60,English,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.60,0:02:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,Don't you think so?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.12,0:02:45.70,English,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.70,0:02:46.66,English,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.66,0:02:48.82,English,,0,0,0,,People want to see books too, but
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.82,0:02:50.78,English,,0,0,0,,when they go to a bookstore, they just,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.78,0:02:54.10,English,,0,0,0,,they go just because they want to look at something, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.10,0:02:55.54,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.54,0:02:58.80,English,,0,0,0,,And they go because they want to spend money, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.80,0:03:00.10,English,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.10,0:03:00.74,English,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.74,0:03:04.10,English,,0,0,0,,Don't they go because they want to spend money?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.10,0:03:04.62,English,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.62,0:03:12.62,English,,0,0,0,,That's not it, they just went there and because there were so many pretty things, they fell into temptation and bought them.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.62,0:03:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,So they end up spending money.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.32,0:03:14.82,English,,0,0,0,,(Ah...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.60,0:03:15.86,English,,0,0,0,,That could be)
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.86,0:03:17.50,English,,0,0,0,,At least I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.50,0:03:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,Of course, I don't want to spend money either.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.56,0:03:26.82,English,,0,0,0,,, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.82,0:03:28.44,English,,0,0,0,,So you can buy it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.44,0:03:31.64,English,,0,0,0,,I go because of that feeling,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.86,English,,0,0,0,,but actually I don't buy everything I look at.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.86,0:03:36.50,English,,0,0,0,,If you buy everything, you'd be in big trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.50,0:03:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.36,0:03:38.98,English,,0,0,0,,You'd run out of money, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.82,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, that would be trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.82,0:03:44.60,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, so I go to bookstores and look at books, look at stationery,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.60,0:03:46.36,English,,0,0,0,,look at computers,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.36,0:03:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,and look at newly released cameras.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.48,0:03:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,I do that often.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.16,0:03:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,Ah~ I also like a bookstore called Bandi & Luni's in Jongno,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.00,0:04:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,and the reason I like that bookstore is because they put chairs in a bookstore for the first time in our country.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.40,0:04:02.54,English,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.54,0:04:03.52,English,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.52,0:04:08.50,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, in the past, people always had no choice but to stand and read books.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.50,0:04:15.54,English,,0,0,0,,so I liked that so much
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.54,0:04:18.42,English,,0,0,0,,that since then, I only go to Bandi & Luni's.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.42,0:04:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's very convenient.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.24,0:04:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.32,0:04:23.74,English,,0,0,0,,But did you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.74,0:04:24.24,English,,0,0,0,,Those...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.10,0:04:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,Other bookstores also have chairs now.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.88,0:04:30.14,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, they have them now.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.14,0:04:31.06,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.06,0:04:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,So I also go to Youngpoong Bookstore, and sometimes I sit in a chair to read books,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.42,English,,0,0,0,,or sometimes,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.42,0:04:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,yeah, I just stand and read, but I like it because I can look at stationery a lot .
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.00,0:04:45.70,English,,0,0,0,,So I go to bookstores often.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.70,0:04:46.20,English,,0,0,0,,(Ah...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.70,0:04:46.46,English,,0,0,0,,) Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.46,0:04:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,I purposely avoid going to places with stationery.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.08,0:04:51.90,English,,0,0,0,,Because I end up spending money.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.90,0:04:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,Yes~ I understand that too.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.28,0:04:55.62,English,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.62,0:04:56.40,English,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.66,English,,0,0,0,,Everyone, do you go to bookstores often?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.66,0:05:03.46,English,,0,0,0,,And are there bookstores, many large bookstores, near your house?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.46,0:05:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, and do you read
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.40,0:05:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,books a lot?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.08,0:05:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.84,0:05:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.40,0:05:11.46,English,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.46,0:05:12.78,English,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.78,0:05:13.94,English,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.94,0:05:19.62,English,,0,0,0,,thank you for listening to the second episode of TalkToMeInKorean.com's Iyagi,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.62,0:05:22.26,English,,0,0,0,,and please tell us your stories.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.26,0:05:24.68,English,,0,0,0,,Yes, please leave them in the comments.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.68,0:05:25.60,English,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.60,0:05:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,Then we will be waiting for your comments.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.24,0:05:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.88,0:05:35.88,English,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
